OL,3,GNEWSARail routes through Guildford
OL,4,Aclosed for works
OL,5,
OL,6,FRailway lines through Guildford have
OL,7,Fbeen temporarily closed due to
OL,8,Fengineering works.
OL,10,FLines will be shut between the town and
OL,11,FAldershot in Hampshire, as well as
OL,12,Fbetween Woking and Haslemere in Surrey,
OL,13,Fthroughout Sunday, according to South
OL,14,FWestern Railway.
OL,16,FIts services between London Waterloo
OL,17,Fand Guildford or Portsmouth Harbour
OL,18,Fwill be replaced by buses for the
OL,19,Fclosed sections of their routes.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
